60;<span title=\"2026-10-10 14:16:47 +08:00\">11h 30m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/yvyvyv\">yvyvyv</a> 用平台模型 不需要电脑配置，但是整合片段得用剪映或者 pr 还是吃点显卡的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18163594\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5fad/1233/367295_normal.png?m=1775722356\" alt=\"iixy\" data-uid=\"367295\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/iixy\">iixy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 14:21:13 +08:00\">11h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>别白费功夫了，追热点永远吃不上热乎的，现阶段只有培训建群拉人能挣点钱。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18163630\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/590e/5397/679956_normal.png?m=1715848101\" alt=\"shtzlwdmkf\" data-uid=\"679956\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/shtzlwdmkf\">shtzlwdmkf</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-10 14:28:21 +08:00\">11h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在做这个，除非你的 token 比别人便宜，烧的起，否则很难入局</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18163646\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a65a/8a2e/658738_normal.png?m=1775204869\" alt=\"widowcat\" data-uid=\"658738\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                   